---
interface Props {
  section?: string;
  sectionEn?: string;
}

const { section = "閱讀空間", sectionEn = "Reading space" } = Astro.props;
---

<aside class="context-rail" aria-label="頁面資訊 Page context">
  <section>
    <p class="context-rail__label">
      目前位置 · <span lang="en">Current section</span>
    </p>
    <h2>{section} <small lang="en">{sectionEn}</small></h2>
    <p>Phase 0 提供導覽與閱讀框架，內容會在後續階段加入。</p>
    <p class="en-subline" lang="en">
      Phase 0 provides the navigation and reading frame. Content arrives in
      later phases.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="context-rail__label">
      快速前往 · <span lang="en">Quick paths</span>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/notes">短篇短札 <span lang="en">Notes</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/articles">長篇文章 <span lang="en">Articles</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/editions">策劃專題 <span lang="en">Editions</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="/archive">日期封存 <span lang="en">Archive</span></a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</aside>

<style>
  .context-rail {
    position: sticky;
    top: var(--space-6);
    display: grid;
    align-content: start;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  section {
    padding: var(--space-5);
    border: 1px solid var(--space-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(38, 24, 49, 0.64);
  }

  section:first-child {
    box-shadow: var(--space-glow-pink);
  }

  .context-rail__label {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
    color: var(--space-gold);
    font-size: var(--font-size--1);
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--font-size-2);
  }

  p {
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 0;
    color: var(--space-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size--1);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--space-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-0);
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
  }

  a:hover {
    color: var(--space-gold-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 68.74rem) {
    .context-rail {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
